		{"id":"65c40871f93a1a9f","type":"text","text":"Standards","x":-172,"y":-1535,"width":155,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"199ee0e2710a1cf6","type":"text","text":"### 802.1D - original STP\n- All VLans share and STP instance\n- cannot load balance","x":-455,"y":-1290,"width":320,"height":155},
		{"id":"e3993f238277a19e","type":"text","text":"### 802.1W - Rapid Spanning Tree\n- All VLans share and STP instance\n- cannot load balance","x":-455,"y":-1135,"width":320,"height":180},
		{"id":"de0a29041ddd70c1","type":"text","text":"### 802.1S - Multiple Spanning Tree\n- Uses modified RSTP mechanics\n- Can group multiple VLans into different instances ( ie. VLans 1-5 in instance 1)","x":-454,"y":-955,"width":320,"height":175},
		{"id":"c37cfb8d20e89b19","type":"text","text":"IEEE","x":-372,"y":-1385,"width":155,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"be48b66a1830f63b","type":"text","text":"STP","x":-675,"y":-1255,"width":155,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e35edc1576d8af2e","type":"text","text":"RSTP","x":-674,"y":-1085,"width":155,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"7f72b28ff87fe40c","type":"text","text":"MSTP","x":-674,"y":-903,"width":155,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af61ac875582b893","type":"text","text":"## No Cisco Equivalent","x":-134,"y":-955,"width":445,"height":175},
		{"id":"c4923ff1bc2528a0","type":"text","text":"### Per-VLan Spanning-tree Plus (PVST+)\n- cisco's upgrade to 802.1D\n- each VLan has its own STP instance","x":-134,"y":-1290,"width":434,"height":155},
		{"id":"83a20ba56aad99b5","type":"text","text":"### Rapid-per-VLan Spanning-Tree Plus (Rapid PVST+)\n- Cisco's upgrade to 802.1W\n- each VLan has its own STP instance\n- Can load balance by blocking different parts in each Vlan (good for small networks)","x":-134,"y":-1135,"width":434,"height":180},
		{"id":"fd56364c76ace172","type":"text","text":"Cisco","x":6,"y":-1385,"width":155,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"6df6169dce9396ef","type":"text","text":"- Undesignated ports\n- receive STP BPDU ONLY\n- Do not send/receive net traffic\n- Do not Learn MAC addr","x":-1660,"y":-278,"width":320,"height":130},
		{"id":"51c2c648dc287926","type":"text","text":"- Root and Designated\n- Send/Receive STP BPDUs\n- Send/Receive Network Traffic\n- Learn Mac Addr","x":-1660,"y":-123,"width":320,"height":130},
