		{"id":"27f10ef0789de13d","type":"text","text":"- for Designated and Root ports\n- Send/receive STP BPDU\n- Do not send/receive net traffic\n- Learn MAC addr from traffic","x":-1660,"y":212,"width":320,"height":150},
		{"id":"a914bfe21c3cedf4","type":"text","text":"- only Designated and Root ports\n- only forward/receive STP BPDUs\n- Do not send/receive net traffic\n- Do not learn MAC addr","x":-1660,"y":32,"width":320,"height":150},
